From a7e57193459302e91302413a3b5bcabf965e980b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:58:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 45/45] Hyper training: pick the IV a Bottle Cap maxes

A man on Goldenrod Department Store 5F takes a Bottle Cap to make the IV the
player picks 31, or a Gold Bottle Cap for all six, at no cost if they are 31
already. The new script command takes the place of the unused command 384
(mon_subtract_friendship). The Bottle Caps no longer work from the bag. Made by
tools/hack/hyper_training.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEYSk2h6k1E1jWo3cHd
